                </div>
                <div class="large-7 columns">
                    <div style="margin:20px;margin-right:80px;">
                        <p><img src="~/Content/Images/oil-trucks.jpg" alt="Conger's Heating &amp; Cooling, Inc 978.728.4757" border="0" style="display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; " /></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="large-5 columns">
                    <div style="margin:20px; text-align:center;">
                        <p><a href="http://www.masssave.com" target="_blank"><img src="~/Content/Images/Logos/mass-save.jpg" alt="Explore numerous energy saving programs at Mass Save!" /></a></p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="large-7 columns">
                    <div style="vertical-align: middle;">
                        <div style="margin:20px;margin-right:80px;">
                            <p>
                                We are are committed to helping our customers however we can from saving energy and money to make each fill up last longer, or to simply ensure that they have resources
                                they need to weather the heating season comfortably. There are a number of exciting programs available from <a href="http://www.masssave.com" target="_blank">MassSave</a>
                                to the <a href="https://www.mocinc.org/fuelassistance" target="_blank">MOC Fuel Asisstance program</a>, see what ones will work for you!
                            </p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="row">
                    <div class="large-12 columns">
                        <div class="panel radius" style="margin:40px;">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="large-3 columns">
